  "title": "SPI2 not generated on STM32L051C8Tx",
  "content": "<p>Hello,</p><p> </p><p>I may be missing something, I cant generate the SPI_init() method within main() (also pins are yellow ?)…</p><p>I have generated;</p><p> </p><pre><code class=\"language-c\">  HAL_Init();<br /><br />  /* Configure the system clock */<br />  SystemClock_Config();<br /><br />  /* Initialize all configured peripherals */<br />  MX_GPIO_Init();</code></pre><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/9061fbc4-c2c7-4e3f-bf06-fff9b5982882.png\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/0914cb09-8cde-4649-9df5-b67e3f00e322.png\" /></figure><p> </p><p>Cheers</p>",
