      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Yellow pins mean the peripheral isn’t enabled.</p><p>In the SPI2 peripheral, enable it by choosing a mode such as two-way master.</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/15820ce2-f842-4551-bf23-1c32ac35d572.png\"/></figure><p> </p></div>"
